$ Milestone 7, §5.5/§12: the `system` standard library module.
$
$ `system.*` is a set of compiler-known dotted-call builtins (see
$ codegen.cpp's genCall `builtins` table and runtime/system.c) -- see
$ filesystem.fly's header comment for why this is a doc-only marker.
$
$ Available after `bring system`:
$
$   system.os()
$   system.arch()
$   system.hostname()
